{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男星彭于晏日前在香港被粉絲捕獲，原來他此行是為出席主演劇集《夜班經理》（The Night Manager）華語版的座談會，他在社交平台上載了當日所拍攝的照片，見彭于晏穿上一套簡約儒雅的休閒服飾，展現從容得體的風度。</p><p>席間他與兩位同是這部</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.556638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.619984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.619984+00:00","content_hash":"bd3f0bfeefe4a41ab744e68664552fe9c10123fe6e5752a2f71337bcf2a846c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}